# Multi-Tenant Design Skill - Thiết Kế Multi-Tenant Architecture Cho SaaS

## Tổng quan

Multi-tenant architecture là nền tảng của SaaS applications, cho phép nhiều tenants (customers) chia sẻ infrastructure trong khi vẫn đảm bảo isolation. Skill này cung cấp framework để thiết kế và implement multi-tenant systems với various isolation strategies.

## Purpose (Mục đích)

Multi-Tenant Design Skill được thiết kế để:

1. **Isolation Strategy**: Choose appropriate isolation level
2. **Tenant Management**: Design tenant lifecycle management
3. **Resource Allocation**: Plan resource distribution
4. **Data Architecture**: Structure tenant data
5. **Cost Optimization**: Optimize infrastructure costs
6. **Compliance**: Meet regulatory requirements

### Khi nào sử dụng Multi-Tenant Design

- Khi designing new SaaS applications
- Khi planning tenant onboarding
- Khi selecting isolation strategy
- Khi optimizing multi-tenant costs
- Khi implementing tenant billing
- Khi designing tenant migration

## Input (Đầu vào)

- [ ] Business requirements
- [ ] Tenant isolation requirements
- [ ] Data sensitivity levels
- [ ] Scaling requirements
- [ ] Compliance requirements
- [ ] Budget constraints

## Output (Đầu ra)

- [ ] Isolation strategy selection
- [ ] Architecture diagram
- [ ] Tenant management design
- [ ] Data model design
- [ ] Resource allocation plan
- [ ] Migration strategy

