## Anti Pattern

- [ ] **Missing tenant_id**: Data leakage risk
- [ ] **No RLS on shared DB**: Cross-tenant access
- [ ] **Hard-coded tenant IDs**: Migration issues
- [ ] **No quota enforcement**: Resource exhaustion
- [ ] **No isolation strategy**: Compliance issues
- [ ] **Shared credentials**: Security vulnerability

## Best Practice

- [ ] **Always use tenant_id**: Every table needs it
- [ ] **Enable RLS**: For shared database strategy
- [ ] **Design for migration**: Between strategies
- [ ] **Enforce quotas**: Prevent resource exhaustion
- [ ] **Automate provisioning**: Consistent tenant setup
- [ ] **Monitor usage**: Track per-tenant metrics

